/webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/491960\n    Reviewed-by: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Owners-Override: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48236}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/DEPS", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/examples/androidjunit/src/org/appspot/apprtc/TCPChannelClientTest.java", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0089.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0093.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0095.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0107.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0140.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/test/android_test_initializer.cc"], "git_node": "8a152811dba479df117a1446ba62ee1f93b077c3", "git_parents": ["386ca3fbe70bf1433d5edf1e472c49b6e84c6a13"], "node": "d9dc34a95863b09043811272916ed7d1579d873e", "parents": ["12783746b2d2a9390c5a158d9d59578053d66b88"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from fed1dbf9c3 - moz.build file updates\n", "files": ["CLOBBER", "third_party/libwebrtc/common_video/common_video_gn/moz.build"], "git_node": "f9daf1319dab483f4ebea67163c16d288e250d78", "git_parents": ["8a152811dba479df117a1446ba62ee1f93b077c3"], "node": "33eb3b5ba402d6d1f0f9d31ebe79d4bd8b856e45", "parents": ["d9dc34a95863b09043811272916ed7d1579d873e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from dd1d31113c\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/dd1d31113c425e6b8a60b26229e27963d9e15bc3\n    Roll chromium_revision ec133cb64d..eba77b508b (1668583:1669022)\n\n    Change log: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+