n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492040\n    Commit-Queue: chromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cchromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Bot-Commit: chromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cchromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48237}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/DEPS", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor"], "git_node": "f5cc69f2f3c0deca291d31ce190bc04ca69024fc", "git_parents": ["f9daf1319dab483f4ebea67163c16d288e250d78"], "node": "87ec5425149b760761a57ba632eff5104d358cc3", "parents": ["33eb3b5ba402d6d1f0f9d31ebe79d4bd8b856e45"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 5ad58d70ee\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/5ad58d70eea10785fab05ba4150e2fe22ecc7f97\n    Roll chromium_revision eba77b508b..d8fc8f85b2 (1669022:1669275)\n\n    Change log: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+log/eba77b508b..d8fc8f85b2\n    Full diff: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/eba77b508b..d8fc8f85b2\n\n    Changed dependencies\n    * src/build: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/build/+log/9ae41161d3..3620d8e450\n    * src/testing: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/testing/+log/654a54f2fe..1d9fa58db0\n    * src/third_party: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/third_party/+log/58fc7c3f07..844bf6e93c\n    * src/third_party/androidx/cipd: 5e8tIF82yxrjotcgfY-UfleN8EGUZU8Ie7nHZYjmXpwC..rLqK0LiODsi6HdXLEg_EclTVHnOjdBBK33RSUAMJNbEC\n    * src/third_party/boringssl/src: https://boringssl.googlesource.com/boringssl.git/+log/572a4c6847..f1f2556a5d\n    * src/third_party/catapult: https://chromium.googlesource.com/catapult.git/+log/d810008022..015082d0ac\n    * src/third_party/depot_tools: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/tools/depot_tools.git/+log/38c391feba..1ea71a39a2\n    * src/third_party/fuzztest/src: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/google/fuzztest.git/+log/239bf6cc1f..228ca7a9f6\n    * src/third_party/grpc/src: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/grpc/grpc.git/+log/e3faa8e6bb..5087d4be81\n    * src/third_party/libaom/source/libaom: https://aomedia.googlesource.com/aom.git/+log/d08a82575d..95f2f18a2b\n    * src/third_party/perfetto: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/google/perfetto.git/+log/9c7ce42050..40643eb44a\n    * src/third_party/zstd/src: https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/facebook/zstd.git/+log/5233c58e6c..5c7b7bad26\n    * src/tools: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/tools/+log/377343128f..1c7a607100\n    * src/tools/luci-go: git_revision:9429fac3f8d3e6389ffdafd9d9fa1eb791dd0fe9..git_revision:bb2729e2a10f361496937e32c0aeb4fdda0c9247\n    * src/tools/luci-go: git_revision:9429fac3f8d3e6389ffdafd9d9fa1eb791dd0fe9..git_revision:bb2729e2a10f361496937e32c0aeb4fdda0c9247\n    * src/tools/luci-go: git_revision:9429fac3f8d3e6389ffdafd9d9fa1eb791dd0fe9..git_revision:bb2729e2a10f361496937e32c0aeb4fdda0c9247\n    DEPS diff: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/eba77b508b..d8fc8f85b2/DEPS\n\n    BUG=None\n\n    Change-Id: Ie5d43afebe5901813815e9058525d94224fa00c7\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492140\n    Bot-Commit: chromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cchromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: chromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cchromium-webrtc-autoroll@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48238}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/DEPS", "third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor"], "git_node": "a6ff4100536f98b9729de1861aab307d46e72b81", "git_parents": ["f5cc69f2f3c0deca291d31ce190bc04ca69024fc"], "node": "d8ee03405c1654cf23675eb747429a8ebeb799c6", "parents": ["87ec5425149b760761a57ba632eff5104d358cc3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 612430e826\n\nWe cherry-picked this in bug 2054625.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/612430e8266881eaff478b0000cacc90fb71c918\n    Video capture: validate PipeWire camera frame size to prevent OOB read\n\n    Check spa_chunk::size is not larger than mmap'ed buffer, which would\n    lead to an out-of-bounds read when the frame is copied. Validate that\n    chunk offset + size does not exceed maxsize before processing.\n\n    Bug: chromium:535260642\n    Change-Id: Id4301cd02f9c946dccadc0f64af1e01bd4462ac2\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/489600\n    Reviewed-by: Ilya Nikolaevskiy \u003cilnik@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Jan Grulich \u003cgrulja@gmail.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48239}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/612430e826.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0144.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0145.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0146.patch"], "git_node": "f3419728ec9695fd788d768c8bc38938631c0426", "git_parents": ["a6ff4100536f98b9729de1861aab307d46e72b81"], "node": "0882bd27a83609c85f1158dbeeb62618902a0e23", "parents": ["d8ee03405c1654cf23675eb747429a8ebeb799c6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 3281a01143\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/3281a01143ea491cbf73ea0e0d77f924bcadf699\n    Remove portaudio dependency and introduce AudioRingBufferMac\n\n    Replace the vendored PortAudio ring buffer (modules/third_party/portaudio)\n    with a lightweight, modern C++ lock-free SPSC AudioRingBufferMac class\n    in modules/audio_device/mac/.\n\n    - Adds AudioRingBufferMac and accompanying unit tests.\n    - Updates AudioDeviceMac to use AudioRingBufferMac instead of PaUtilRingBuffer.\n    - Upcoming CLs will remove PortAudio.\n\n    TAG=agy\n    CONV=2d0880c7-8a5b-4e46-938b-9382f073ace4\n\n    Bug: chromium:538007096\n    Change-Id: I4a37504da97388a33504b3248eb14cdf45aed402\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/490821\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Fredrik Solenberg \u003csolenberg@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48240}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_device/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_device/mac/audio_device_mac.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_device/mac/audio_device_mac.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_device/mac/audio_ring_buffer_mac.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_device/mac/audio_ring_buffer_mac_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0095.patch"], "git_node": "9fcfb0840a0c60b608eb45de53b867e92d66b6f7", "git_parents": ["f3419728ec9695fd788d768c8bc38938631c0426"], "node": "3ba78c7eb74ea126ebe94b545fc9495ff78738a1", "parents": ["0882bd27a83609c85f1158dbeeb62618902a0e23"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from a0b1dfd197\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/a0b1dfd19796b70d8b4343eb70ead8454188cee7\n    Delete refactoring plan as completed\n\n    All variants with 'void*' are already deleted from rtc_base/byte_order.h\n\n    No-Try: true\n    Bug: webrtc:484070270\n    Change-Id: I9e3cbd127045de550d361cb2a77211b0553acc92\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492240\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Artem Titov \u003ctitovartem@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48241}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/g3doc/todo/byte_order_safety.md"], "git_node": "1371fee519507e9755d8be3b7dafa662219e7d29", "git_parents": ["9fcfb0840a0c60b608eb45de53b867e92d66b6f7"], "node": "b785983da32b0525257a108a084e25f3dc1f6e14", "parents": ["3ba78c7eb74ea126ebe94b545fc9495ff78738a1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 75dbe4c321\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/75dbe4c321a68de5f1ecccaee25229ba504877d7\n    Fix flakiness in ParameterlessSetLocalDescriptionUsesLastCreatedOffer\n\n    Disables ICE candidate gathering in the test by configuring the\n    PeerConnection with IceTransportsType::kNone.\n\n    Previously, the test asserted that the applied local description matched\n    the created offer SDP exactly. However, SetLocalDescription starts ICE\n    gathering asynchronously. If gathering progresses and finds a physical\n    interface before the local description is read, the description gets\n    updated with candidates and the m= line port changes, causing the string\n    comparison to fail.\n\n    Disabling gathering ensures the local description remains identical to\n    the created offer SDP.\n\n    Failed run:\n    https://chromium-swarm.appspot.com/task?id=79bc98b7af8ffc11&o=true&w=true\n\n    Bug: none\n    Change-Id: Ibd34106db68385953c4bda12e6f64c8607df01d6\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492000\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Po