@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from c85f47251c\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/c85f47251c1ed02e7e56fcac4698b92f09cbeb81\n    Fix potential OOB accesses in H26x parsers\n\n    Bug: b/510363251\n    Change-Id: I976d9422748b032e395de0c49e001dffa5a15c14\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492460\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Sergey Silkin \u003cssilkin@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Sergey Silkin \u003cssilkin@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48256}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/common_video/h264/h264_common.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/common_video/h264/pps_parser.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/common_video/h264/pps_parser_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/common_video/h264/sps_parser.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/common_video/h264/sps_parser_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/video_rtp_depacketizer_h264_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/h264_sps_pps_tracker.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/h264_sps_pps_tracker_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/h26x_packet_buffer.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/h26x_packet_buffer_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "6d5178367f70465b6a34a15af7c1c278709d4ad5", "git_parents": ["9e325c3a55ab66abaea513f504c91459ac87d770"], "node": "a91bfb229d146e866b9920898d63d48d402d558f", "parents": ["d6bf18b3fd01c1bbb4f9e817d120704e3b71ac2e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 79633e1a84\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/79633e1a8451099d71d39d6dedc2b9cc8ccbd109\n    In RTCPReceiver ignore TargetBitrate message\n\n    This message is non standard and deprecated in favor of\n    VideoLayersAllocation RTP header extension. It is already not used when\n    received, so parsing can be skipped too.\n\n    Note that this change doesn't remove sending such message, leaving\n    that for another cleanup\n\n    Bug: webrtc:42222127\n    Change-Id: I72ae90e0ebe9910ff5299a2fecf119999401b825\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492560\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48257}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/video/video_bitrate_allocator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtcp_receiver.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtcp_receiver.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtcp_receiver_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_rtcp_interface.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0003.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0004.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0035.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0042.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0066.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0080.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0099.patch"], "git_node": "971eee3bb18ca1bfa84468b75c60932c4b521c00", "git_parents": ["6d5178367f70465b6a34a15af7c1c278709d4ad5"], "node": "7b3f1c0927c6aae18f156549254ad56ede45dd82", "parents": ["a91bfb229d146e866b9920898d63d48d402d558f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from bebdb60610\n\nEssentially a no-op since we're going to see this change\nreverted when we vendor in ed70927601.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/bebdb6061029e9d235902684f4463fc7bc16cdad\n    Add RTPVideoFrameSenderInterface::SendVideoFrame\n\n    This method replaces RTPVideoFrameSenderInterface::SendVideo, it takes a\n    RtpTimestampInfo object as an input parameter instead of a uint32_t.\n\n    Bug: chromium:524901718\n    Change-Id: I4c5ede0f2502d90e326e32ee47809f68ff42ca18\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492400\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Guido Urdaneta \u003cguidou@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Leonardo Evi \u003cevil@chromium.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48258}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/ed70927601.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0001.patch"], "git_node": "e32b763e33a7c4714a2fbd1445c7077e6aa02f0a", "git_parents": ["971eee3bb18ca1bfa84468b75c60932c4b521c00"], "node": "6035dbd2ffbccba3f8c180f6c1854f74209db8bb", "parents": ["7b3f1c0927c6aae18f156549254ad56ede45dd82"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from ed70927601\n\nWe already cherry-picked this when we vendored bebdb60610.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/ed7092760180c065a5106e1555f25274e26dcc1c\n    Revert \"Add RTPVideoFrameSenderInterface::SendVideoFrame\"\n\n    This reverts commit bebdb6061029e9d235902684f4463fc7bc16cdad.\n\n    Reason for revert: Breaks internal tests\n\n    Failure Link: \u003cLINK TO FAILURE\u003e\n\n    Original change's description:\n    \u003e Add RTPVideoFrameSenderInterface::SendVideoFrame\n    \u003e\n    \u003e This method replaces RTPVideoFrameSenderInterface::SendVideo, it takes a\n    \u003e RtpTimestampInfo object as an input parameter instead of a uint32_t.\n    \u003e\n    \u003e Bug: chromium:524901718\n    \u003e Change-Id: I4c5ede0f2502d90e326e32ee47809f68ff42ca18\n    \u003e Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492400\n    \u003e Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Reviewed-by: Guido Urdaneta \u003cguidou@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Commit-Queue: Leonardo Evi \u003cevil@chromium.org\u003e\n    \u003e Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48258}\n\n    Bug: chromium:524901718\n    No-Presubmit: true\n    No-Tree-Checks: true\n    No-Try: true\n    Change-Id: Ic07124ba2382c16cc8a2fb8ff4aedaf909b6c6bc\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492740\n    Reviewed-by: Ilya Nikolaevskiy \u003cilnik@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Bot-Commit: rubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com \u003crubber-stamper@appspot.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Owners-Override: Ilya Nikolaevskiy \u003cilnik@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Ilya Nikolaevskiy \u003cilnik@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48259}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/ed70927601.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/p0001.patch"], "git_node": "44cdcabee5b5b0f12031e7243c40589ea6e7dea8", "git_parents": ["e32b763e33a7c4714a2fbd1445c7077e6aa02f0a"], "node": "22d8d428067c1c9eb767136fdb9518a48929e42f", "parents": ["6035dbd2ffbccba3f8c180f6c1854f74209db8bb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 417f300bba\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/417f300bbac74067480822c570694dd7d32b0da7\n    Pass Environment to VCMTiming and DefaultVideoJitterTiming.\n\n    Removes obsolete constructor in DefaultVideoJitterTiming.\n\n    Bug: b/493549134\n    Change-Id: Iaef4c447301f435daae859cd135d85e7f98b4864\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492220\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48260}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/call.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/generic_decoder_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/timing.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/timing.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/timing/timing_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/video_receiver2_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/frame_decode_timing_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/default_video_jitter_timing.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/default_video_jitter_timing.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_simulator.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/timing/simulator/rendering_tracker_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_receive_stream2_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_stream_buffer_controller_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "c5676027c700387dd6e3bb72a7a2cb9abcb5a643", "git_parents": ["44cdcabee5b5b0f12031e7243c40589ea6e7dea8"], "node": "4b904edc37c46089c45f3a13367a2cfddef34fe3", "parents": ["22d8d428067c1c9eb767136fdb9518a48929e42f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from aa2d5966f5\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/aa2d5966f5bca5c6b2c7162d28c93848c05e3e36\n    Delete TmbrInformation::last_time_received member\n\n    This member is practically unused - it is read once to pass current time\n    where it is cleaner to query current time from the clock directly.\n    Removing need to set it simplifies code.\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I3f33fb8150697ee632511b63805c03405a8bcf37\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492720\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48261}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtcp_receiver.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtcp_receiver.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0003.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0004.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0035.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0042.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0066.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0099.patch"], "git_node": "cb97c4bb09f5a2252cca02d4205d964517c02f29", "git_parents": ["c5676027c700387dd6e3bb72a7a2cb9abcb5a643"], "node": "1cf91df60af3e0862fdd988e7f77319d61e95b8d", "parents": ["4b904edc37c46089c45f3a13367a2cfddef34fe3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 318e4979df\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/318e4979dfa65ef61b51bc9e0e70572cd02ad8e4\n    In RtcpReceiver ignore remote_ssrc when collecting RTTs\n\n    This class intends to watch RTCP traffic from single transport and thus\n    doesn't need to support RTT per remote sender.\n\n    Bug: b/510362788\n    Change-Id: Ie94bd6a210e23b9f8ae4eaf12596cfa80cd4c3d1\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492701\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48262}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtcp_receiver.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtcp_receiver.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0003.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0004.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0035.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0042.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0066.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0099.patch"], "git_node": "bb9b89ddff213d239c1afe1eb4987e8a0aff010a", "git_parents": ["cb97c4bb09f5a2252cca02d4205d964517c02f29"], "node": "c3b1b2b6057df82f56da2279cbdd024385c82dcc", "parents": ["1cf91df60af3e0862fdd988e7f77319d61e95b8d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from c9baebb35d\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/c9baebb35dd26aaecb06f7e440e3422a08a38740\n    Restore video_config_tests in video_tests test suite\n\n    When video_tests was split out from video_engine_tests in\n    https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/466820,\n    video_config_tests was omitted from the test suite and remained declared\n    as an rtc_library. Change video_config_tests to rtc_cc_test and include\n    it in video_tests.\n\n    TAG=agy\n    CONV=d66788f3-f0f5-4e4a-b0e5-d865c67f4cae\n\n    Bug: webrtc:498394143\n    Change-Id: Icae27577293429571edbaf70e2a30eba251f8874\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492700\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Auto-Submit: Sergey Silkin \u003cssilkin@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48263}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/config/BUILD.gn"], "git_node": "273adad394c36f5e282e1232be955b6953377c7a", "git_parents": ["bb9b89ddff213d239c1afe1eb4987e8a0aff010a"], "node": "0a4da444aca1d28fa2533457c3ddaf44a4dd993e", "parents": ["c3b1b2b6057df82f56da2279cbdd024385c82dcc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Fr