ersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Reviewed-by: Guido Urdaneta \u003cguidou@webrtc.org\u003e\n    \u003e Commit-Queue: Leonardo Evi \u003cevil@chromium.org\u003e\n    \u003e Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48258}\n\n    Bug: chromium:524901718\n    Change-Id: I5e2af3957dc6649d32d44319d970378f7b64bea3\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492780\n    Commit-Queue: Leonardo Evi \u003cevil@chromium.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Guido Urdaneta \u003cguidou@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48265}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/nack_rtx_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_rtcp_impl2_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_sender_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_sender_video.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_sender_video.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_sender_video_frame_transformer_delegate.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_sender_video_frame_transformer_delegate.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_sender_video_frame_transformer_delegate_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/rtp_rtcp/source/rtp_sender_video_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0071.patch"], "git_node": "cffb363d0c287f0ed9fb7767b1f110a26c1e4223", "git_parents": ["433263d13caef6778bd44a585e56a36f77f973d3"], "node": "1a7640a7f408b4bd394225bb8b73c85a7067b095", "parents": ["721ab570bc5af272d9b1fff39a80f85c06118340"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from a898fdd02f\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/a898fdd02f92e1aaafe0bcc9181985762051f12f\n    Remove WebRTC-RtcEventLogNewFormat field trial\n\n    The WebRTC-RtcEventLogNewFormat field trial has fully launched in Chrome\n    and the new format is now used by default. This change removes the field trial\n    fallback check in CreateEncoder and PeerConnection::StartRtcEventLog, so\n    RtcEventLogImpl unconditionally uses RtcEventLogEncoderNewFormat.\n\n    Also contributes to address b/144833892.\n\n    TAG=agy\n    CONV=ac69de71-4eeb-4b00-b142-f66d9edf397b\n\n    Bug: b/145204078\n    Change-Id: Ie6c287d603c34b0340503c4f7cbb0f6fb64a3882\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/492500\n    Commit-Queue: Fredrik Solenberg \u003csolenberg@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Bj\u00f6rn Terelius \u003cterelius@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48266}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/experiments/field_trials.py", "third_party/libwebrtc/logging/rtc_event_log/rtc_event_log_impl.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/logging/rtc_event_log/rtc_event_log_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/pc/peer_connection.cc"], "git_node": "e6fc10a9f5b6b0d13eb8ffed60dad5ba58deacd0", "git_parents": ["cffb363d0c287f0ed9fb7767b1f110a26c1e4223"], "node": "44c3c2937f670a2ec1ee9c3564fe6792186452b8", "parents": ["1a7640a7f408b4bd394225bb8b73c85a7067b095"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 9813003c2c\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/9813003c2cb78b32f99a421b30258f9e527ce82a\n    Have one rtc_library per test under modules subdirectories\n\n    Change-Id: I1ce6f7efe324e0b9bc6a01b713389a3e2a2cf37d\n    Bug: webrtc:498394143\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/491600\n    Commit-Queue: Jeremy Leconte \u003cjleconte@google.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{