ce.com/c/src/+/493100\n    Bot-Commit: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: webrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com \u003cwebrtc-version-updater@webrtc-ci.iam.gserviceaccount.com\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48270}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/call/version.cc"], "git_node": "cfb02bbac6943dddab0bb89dac784b1d7c52a301", "git_parents": ["f67d431a637c7e01c71e952260d7eaeabc8fdd75"], "node": "f8c4b89f62d4daabf9d66299a3fac40054502f5c", "parents": ["d2e600f2f07c569dacd28cf86e9df392486b5ecb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 6e1f18c355\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/6e1f18c355e3839aa8a392e3707b786d051ccd24\n    Include x11/shared_x_display.h only if defined(WEBRTC_USE_X11).\n\n    The x11 specific header is guarded in the header file but not in\n    the .cc file.\n\n    Bug: None\n    Change-Id: I1cf126f9fe6928a1fa510fedd7d16e0a3eb77695\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/493160\n    Auto-Submit: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48271}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/desktop_capture/desktop_capture_options.cc"], "git_node": "0583cae93dbd11c254cb6b00d569e9dc45fbcad9", "git_parents": ["cfb02bbac6943dddab0bb89dac784b1d7c52a301"], "node": "9373fbaaae90ab6694b806418f024be0b0b75015", "parents": ["f8c4b89f62d4daabf9d66299a3fac40054502f5c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc fr