  Change-Id: I865e4736f52be1a0dfce47827181dc072630bb57\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/495620\n    Commit-Queue: Jan Grulich \u003cgrulja@gmail.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Ilya Nikolaevskiy \u003cilnik@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Andreas Pehrson \u003capehrson@mozilla.com\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Per Kjellander \u003cperkj@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48344}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/a0253ec15b.no-op-cherry-pick-msg", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0091.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0144.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0145.patch"], "git_node": "d7dfc862dd7aa66115144fadd9883de77e0f5819", "git_parents": ["b354b8452aefba547be83e3fea0dbfeaaa2ad51f"], "node": "480bb8a89e9cebcd31de3c2e8d3d673c16838314", "parents": ["a8af87d8885220b19db14702081c2cb8ae4f2814"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 4043c5aef5\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/4043c5aef51faeb11529c2c0045d6f67acf1f55d\n    Process messages on current thread in WaitUntil sleep\n\n    Unconditionally process messages on the current thread (if one exists)\n    during WaitUntil sleep. In tests using simulated clocks, the current\n    thread may act as the signaling thread and receive posted tasks that\n    must be dispatched during WaitUntil().\n\n    Bug: none\n    Change-Id: Iaf0cbe9fb9a9365d29ecd6bcc0cb9bf332d5750c\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/495820\n    Reviewed-by: Mirko Bonadei \u003cmbonadei@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48345}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/wait_until.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/test/wait_until_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "4350fb3d6aedb9f18645298303aee1866eadd45e", "git_parents": ["d7dfc862dd7aa66115144fadd9883de77e0f5819"], "node": "021981d88d6e7e4b69d23f48d9ff4f196a74089d", "parents": ["480bb8a89e9cebcd31de3c2e8d3d673c16838314"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 93351b4ed8\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/93351b4ed894235cc612494ac2c8342ef3f80f0f\n    Add peah@webrtc.org to api/audio_codecs/OWNERS, api/neteq/OWNERS,\n    modules/audio_coding/OWNERS, modules/audio_device/OWNERS, and\n    modules/audio_mixer/OWNERS.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:483056241\n    Change-Id: Ib17be4337493eb0b4a8c4fbce2a4d60613153b47\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/494040\n    Reviewed-by: Henrik Lundin \u003chenrik.lundin@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Per \u00c5hgren \u003cpeah@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Fredrik Solenberg \u003csolenberg@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48346}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/audio_codecs/OWNERS", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/neteq/OWNERS", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_coding/OWNERS", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_device/OWNERS", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/audio_mixer/OWNERS"], "git_node": "f5280ce7e036ce13eac8619347ad5c946c2c508a", "git_parents": ["4350fb3d6aedb9f18645298303aee1866eadd45e"], "node": "a1efe2092d9e66089816e56f301d561106c17e2d", "parents": ["021981d88d6e7e4b69d23f48d9ff4f196a74089d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 7319cb19a4\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/7319cb19a40a685b97252e2525439f0841020b6e\n    Return const references from member getters\n\n    Return const references from member getters across\n    network, crypto, video frame metadata, and experiment settings to avoid\n    redundant string and vector copies.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:374845009\n    Change-Id: I10db3e8c67fe12b302fd1bc405bab3981c654ddd\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/495800\n    Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Fredrik Solenberg \u003csolenberg@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48347}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/crypto/crypto_options.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/video/video_frame_metadata.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/video/video_frame_metadata.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/logging/rtc_event_log/events/rtc_event_log_parse_status.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_capture/linux/pipewire_session.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0091.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/port_allocator.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/turn_port.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/p2p/base/turn_port.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/experiments/balanced_degradation_settings.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/experiments/balanced_degradation_settings.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/experiments/encoder_info_settings.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/experiments/field_trial_list.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/experiments/field_trial_parser.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/network.h"], "git_node": "ada75d11e17827d965357ffb5b3f9577e4951a80", "git_parents": ["f5280ce7e036ce13eac8619347ad5c946c2c508a"], "node": "c1f9af62c439a96ae87ff721862507a076e439ea", "parents": ["a1efe2092d9e66089816e56f301d561106c17e2d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from a06d81e3c2\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/a06d81e3c29e17b6b72327d98c47d3ec39f9a22a\n    Remove WebRTC-ZeroPlayoutDelay field trial\n\n    Removes the WebRTC-ZeroPlayoutDelay field trial and promotes its\n    default parameters to constants:\n\n    - Min pacing: 8 ms in FrameDecodeTiming\n    - Max decode queue size: 8 frames in VideoStreamBufferController\n\n    Updates associated unit tests in FrameDecodeTiming and\n    VideoStreamBufferController to test default behaviors.\n\n    Bug: chromium:40228487\n    Change-Id: I69d5d80231a680b1d80f9c19d5a8ef9dca772b81\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/495780\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Johannes Kron \u003ckron@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48348}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/experiments/field_trials.py", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0057.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0059.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/frame_decode_timing.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/frame_decode_timing.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/frame_decode_timing_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_stream_buffer_controller.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_stream_buffer_controller.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/video_stream_buffer_controller_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "fa55b9637338422327ea2a1727d6ad1575dd2f90", "git_parents": ["ada75d11e17827d965357ffb5b3f9577e4951a80"], "node": "0e6c92f5ba4ef4febb19fbba1bd577525e14147f", "parents": ["c1f9af62c439a96ae87ff721862507a076e439ea"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 75e841e151\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/75e841e15198741a70274a05a134c88cf8e31808\n    Roll chromium_revision b11e125134..5c3cb70970 (1678529:1678751)\n\n    Change log: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+log/b11e125134..5c3cb70970\n    Full diff: h