h", "third_party/libwebrtc/rtc_base/operations_chain_unittest.cc"], "git_node": "a38f5ca9c49ac3696b11b055ab2f8f21c3a2a017", "git_parents": ["8d73e1fb0abe46dd2f22a8b1b0ecad729148c142"], "node": "b4d357e097405ca4ba659098f6723833105b0cbe", "parents": ["591d13a4321aad84ac7fe00c1aab72ba32e23c4f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmfroman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064200 - Vendor libwebrtc from 7c8b7a6fdb\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/7c8b7a6fdb403928d379fa081f17a3d9aff1a678\n    Reorganize RtpVideoStreamReceiver2::ReceivePacket implementation.\n\n    Move PacketBuffer::Packet construction outside OnReceivePayloadData to\n    prepare for stashing that object instead of recreating it during each\n    unstashing.\n\n    Bug: b/510362066\n    Change-Id: I8db85fffc9181b10c1c0e39ed5092ced0afaf1bc\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/495940\n    Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48357}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0027.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0030.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0035.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0037.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0042.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0057.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0058.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0059.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0060.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/s0139.patch", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/BUILD.gn", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/rtp_video_stream_receiver2.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/rtp_video_stream_receiver2.h"], "git_node": "cefbabbf5e59570eb38231a423ec9e97378c0d3e", "git_parents": ["a38f5ca9c49ac3696b11b055ab2f8f21c3a2a017"]