orts nested \"nova\" keys for overrides\n- Incidental bug fixes:\n  - Fixes incorrect file name suggestions in `.tokens.css` file comments\n  - Fixes an issue where `calc` could be parsed into padding/margin shorthand\n  - Removes `.anonymous-content-host` from selectors that don't need it\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311175\n", "files": ["toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/figma-tokens-config.js", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/desktop-format/create-desktop-format.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/desktop-format/format-token.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/desktop-format/get-browser-theme-value.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/desktop-format/get-layer-string.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/desktop-format/get-token-css.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/desktop-format/get-token-sections.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/desktop-format/get-tokens-by-layer.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/desktop-format/group-and-sort-tokens.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/desktop-format/is-component-token.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/desktop-format/should-skip-token.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/desktop-format/should-transform-browser-theme-value.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/attempt-padding-margin-destructuring.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/attempt-shadow-destructuring.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/constants.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/create-figma-format.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/filters.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/get-nested-brand-color.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/get-nested-system-color.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/get-override-files.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/get-override-formats.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/get-token-collection.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/is-nested-default-object.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/parse-box-shadow.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/potentially-transform-value.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/replace-references.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/resolve-css-calc.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/transform-token-value.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/figma-format/transforms.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/general/custom-file-header.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/general/get-component-info.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/general/json-parser.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/general/override-identifiers.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/general/replace-references.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/general/token-categories.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/general/token-paths.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/nova-newtab-format/create-nova-newtab-format.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/nova-newtab-format/get-newtab-token-css.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/nova-newtab-format/newtab-file-header.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/config/helpers/nova-newtab-format/post-process-nov