"default", "desc": "Bug 2062778 - don't skip synchronous pref writes if an async pref write is already queued r=beth\n\nThis issue was mostly fixed in bug 2053962, but this is a corner case that\nwasn't handled correctly.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319202\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/Preferences.cpp", "modules/libpref/test/browser/browser.toml", "modules/libpref/test/browser/browser_savePrefFile_explicit_target.js"], "git_node": "c177a7da7586d9e41d66893c25b6c8bdbb236341", "git_parents": ["055d8a6648baef33b169c48d20c3b706f4a12efa"], "node": "7f06f7cd1468b9111a0b09481fc3d88a340a0b63", "parents": ["fe82a9bebf93db6777258a3c84ef1a556be56ddb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicholas Rishel \u003cnrishel@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061499 - Add UploadInitMemTracker to manage zeroing memory for partial texture uploads and marking uninitialized memory as initialized. r=lsalzman\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321124\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLTextureUpload.cpp", "dom/canvas/gtest/TestWebGLTextureUploadInit.cpp", "dom/canvas/gtest/moz.build"], "git_node": "e965d74906f3c88a655cbe53ac73016b1fc9ddd2", "git_parents": ["c177a7da7586d9e41d66893c25b6c8bdbb236341"], "node": "a3f9dd4b0b3c66cec3114293a6cf54685fb6a19b", "parents": ["7f06f7cd1468b9111a0b09481fc3d88a340a0b63"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067194 - Add meta.review_group to 35 mots modules missing one. r=zeid DONTBUILD\n\nWithout a review group, `mach file-info reviewers` has nothing to suggest for\nthe paths these modules own and degrades to tallying `r=` trailers from version\ncontrol history. 556 first-party directories at depth \u003c= 3 matched neither a\nHerald rule nor a mots group; 122 of them were owned by a module that simply\nexposed no group. This covers 120 of them.\n\nThe group for each module comes from `git log --full-diff --name-only`\nrestricted to commits where at least half the touched files belong to the\nmodule, keeping only the clearly dominant group. Modules whose history is\ngenuinely split (Core: Widget, Application Startup, mozharness, Tryselect,\nCore: Animation, Core: Credentials, Core: Mozglue, Core: HAL) are left for\ntheir owner to decide.\n\nNew entries use `dom-core-reviewers` rather than the `dom-core` already in the\nfile: over the last 5000 commits `dom-core` on its own is unused. The existing\nstale values (`dom-core`, `anti-tracking`, `cookies`) are left untouched.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321886\n", "files": ["mots.yaml"], "git_node": "648fdf4877b7d0a701c9e0455c312ed9a8a66c36", "git_parents": ["e965d74906f3c88a655cbe53ac73016b1fc9ddd2"], "node": "104c92851bdf90834a6645451c58e466af1c8cfe", "parents": ["a3f9dd4b0b3c66cec3114293a6cf54685fb6a19b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Leo Tenenbaum \u003cltenenbaum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066875 - Add feature for EditContext API to Nimbus feature manifest. r=masayuki,nimbus-reviewers,beth\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321673\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/nimbus/FeatureManifest.yaml"], "git_node": "36ec1f4c980426d730342e9e41b213cce79fcad7", "git_parents": ["648fdf4877b7d0a701c9e0455c312ed9a8a66c36"], "node": "9c31b5a8b3036ffeaa1657509cfa88371d868efa", "parents": ["104c92851bdf90834a6645451c58e466af1c8cfe"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maile Lucks \u003cmaile.lucks@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064553 - Create ConversationStore and integrate into Conversation model - r=omarg,ai-security-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320172\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/base/content/test/static/browser_all_files_referenced.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/Tools.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/ConversationMigrations.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/ConversationSql.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/ConversationStore.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/moz.build", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/xpcshell/test_ConversationStore.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/xpcshell/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "0aba57d0e21ba7ff9fdf27d32d88949c89739614", "git_parents": ["36ec1f4c980426d730342e9e41b213cce79fcad7"], "node": "8dc33e9c31a44e9447e8d8ee3a8277407b0ce734", "parents": ["9c31b5a8b3036ffeaa1657509cfa88371d868efa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Devin Rousso \u003chi@devinrousso.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 325891 - Dispatch `DOMContentLoaded` for XSLT result documents r=smaug\n\nDocuments created by XSLT skip the normal document load lifecycle, so they reach `\"load\"` without dispatching `\"DOMContentLoaded\"`.\n\nBegin and end the load of the resulting document before and after the XSLT transform so lifecycle events remain ordered.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321704\n", "files": ["dom/html/test/test_bug347174_xsl.html", "dom/xml/nsXMLContentSink.cpp"], "git_node": "a76e6393486ac15b123e1b8b9598ff903de337cb", "git_parents": ["0aba57d0e21ba7ff9fdf27d32d88949c89739614"], "node": "c2c56a25e197edfcb9898b5eb7033c5322177891", "parents": ["8dc33e9c31a44e9447e8d8ee3a8277407b0ce734"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065712 - Rebase unpoison-thread-stacks patch for clang trunk after the IN_SECTION refactor. r=ahochheiden\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321749\n", "files": ["build/build-clang/clang-trunk.json", "build/build-clang/unpoison-thread-stacks_clang_24.patch"], "git_node": "b7dc65636c40d3916a352cedd5c39cd7f65c6b5c", "git_parents": ["a76e6393486ac15b123e1b8b9598ff903de337cb"], "node": "8971ccc7065439b62498801f2d9de5289198d81b", "parents": ["c2c56a25e197edfcb9898b5eb7