that weren't necessary (in particular\nEntry::HasFilter matching on *entry directly rather than adding a\n&mut pattern), renamed a few `gen` locals in bench code since `gen` is\nnow a reserved keyword.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322206\n", "files": ["servo/components/selectors/Cargo.toml", "servo/components/selectors/attr.rs", "servo/components/selectors/bloom.rs", "servo/components/selectors/matching.rs", "servo/components/selectors/parser.rs", "servo/components/selectors/relative_selector/filter.rs"], "git_node": "d0f47a3db753d2ada1ef8485fb321ad362bd79b5", "git_parents": ["14164a2ffa394d932d57aed47e31dd0f80109978"], "node": "b2576396f5a2135b35bd32a28247bed1ce85efd3", "parents": ["ae71b845aaed45a9844d24e902659b4cc4eea38c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jeremy Swinarton \u003cjswinarton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057863: Re-enable tabbrowser tabs/browser.toml on Linux tsan r=tabbrowser-reviewers,niklas\n\nFix the test in browser_testOpenNewRemoteTabsFromNonRemoteBrowsers.js\nfor Linux TSan builds. It rewrites the tests in this file to open and\nclose one test window per case, which removes the promiseWaitForFocus\ndependency on window focus order.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321380\n", "files": ["browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser.toml", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser_testOpenNewRemoteTabsFromNonRemoteBrowsers.js"], "git_node": "cac74b07ce43bad4f870f4c3b28212aa054c50b0", "git_parents": ["d0f47a3db753d2ada1ef8485fb321ad362bd79b5"], "node": "90d050fa0221c63f9359839e8274cfd899f3381f", "parents": ["b2576396f5a2135b35bd32a28247bed1ce85efd3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Exploding-Joysticks \u003cExplodingJoysticks@proton.me\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2004869 - Remove the media.rvfc.enable pref r=webidl,smaug\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322117\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/te