": "Bug 2067160 - Key the bug-filing skill's summary guidance to the bug type. r=padenot,ai4dev-reviewers DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321870\n", "files": [".agents/skills/bug-filing/SKILL.md", ".claude/skills/bug-filing/SKILL.md"], "git_node": "b51f0239911894746f8b899132a70f03205946d7", "git_parents": ["9061d066706a6fe9d9b2f80176b692938bcd6e3a"], "node": "12eb4e70c0fa513e6901e2408fd4d742b007b37d", "parents": ["08b92a67b607014722cfa090127db1a3df518a4e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "agoloman \u003cagoloman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2059513 - Ignore errors when the urlbar actor is already destroyed. r=dao,urlbar-reviewers\" for causing bc failures @browser_ext_themes_ntp_colors_perwindow.js.\n\nThis reverts commit 2241863da3ca10618ccd652e4e3056235add1539.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2059513 - Don't defer switcher icon init in newtab. r=dao,urlbar-reviewers\"\n\nThis reverts commit 20d60fa20fdb4753fdb43fc8dfbb4d8dc64052b6.\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/actors/UrlbarChild.sys.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/content/UrlbarInputBase.mjs"], "git_node": "e412703d502be9b6b77e0f8e661eb5a5a319f8fb", "git_parents": ["b51f0239911894746f8b899132a70f03205946d7"], "node": "62b9ff1a1e993e254186d22b507ef078ccac55da", "parents": ["12eb4e70c0fa513e6901e2408fd4d742b007b37d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Max Inden \u003cmail@max-inden.de\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066477 - Update nss-rs to 0.14.6 r=necko-reviewers,leggert\n\nBump the vendored nss-rs (and its test-fixture crate) from 0.13.4 to\n0.14.6, which the neqo v0.31.0 update requires.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321287\n", "files": ["Cargo.lock", "netwerk/socket/neqo_glue/Cargo.toml", "security/lockstore/lockstore_rs/Cargo.toml", "security/mls/mls_gk/Cargo.toml", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/.cargo-checksum.json", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/Cargo.lock", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/Cargo.toml", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/README.md", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/build.rs", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/install-nss/action.yml", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/min_version.txt", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/src/constants.rs", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/src/ec.rs", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/src/ech.rs", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/src/hp/header_protection.rs", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/src/hp/header_protection_blapi.rs", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/src/lib.rs", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/src/min_version.rs", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/tests/ec.rs", "third_party/rust/nss-rs/tests/handshake.rs", "third_party/rust/test-fixture/.cargo-checksum.json", "third_party/rust/test-fixture/Cargo.toml"], "git_node": "fe4d0aa2a4c1cb1cd65d0b435b541e457396f328", "git_parents": ["e412703d502be9b6b77e0f8e661eb5a5a319f8fb"], "node": "07ed8ace78520d6114610754fa99d822af7e5b54", "parents": ["62b9ff1a1e993e254186d22b507ef078ccac55da"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Max Inden \u003cmail@max-inden.de\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066480 - Update mls-platform-api to eb1c880 r=supply-chain-reviewers,leggert,afranchuk\n\nBump mls-platform-api so mls-rs-crypto-nss builds against nss-rs 0.14.\nAdd a git-delta audit for mls-rs-provider-sqlite.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321289\n", "files": [".cargo/config.toml.in", "Cargo.lock", "security/mls/mls_gk/Cargo.toml", "supply-chain/audits.toml", "third_party/rust/mls-rs-crypto-nss/.cargo-checksum.json", "third_party/rust/mls-rs-crypto-nss/Cargo.toml"], "git_node": "561deccccb44d3f1b5481da5b5298a021156316b", "git_parents": ["fe4d0aa2a4c1cb1cd65d0b435b541e457396f328"], "node": "df07cee79f20a074fef4217c80fe6775befae721", "parents": ["07ed8ace78520d6114610754fa99d822af7e5b54"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Max Inden \u003cmail@max-inden.de\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065405 - Update neqo to v0.31.0 r=necko-reviewers,supply-chain-reviewers,leggert,kershaw,afranchuk\n\nBump the vendored neqo crates from v0.30.1 to v0.31.0 (mozilla/neqo#3880)\nand adapt neqo_glue: drop the HTTP/3 server-push handling neqo removed,\nmap the new TooManyPtos transport error, and read cwnd as a plain value.\nAdd a git-delta audit for mtu, a neqo workspace crate.\n\nAlso strip connection-specific header fields when http3server forwards a\nresponse over HTTP/3: neqo v0.31.0 (mozilla/neqo#3806) rejects them as\nmalformed per RFC 9114, Section 4.2, which otherwise breaks the h3\nxpcshell tests.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321290\n", "files": [".cargo/config.toml.in", "Cargo.lock", "netwerk/socket/neqo_glue/Cargo.toml", "netwerk/socket/neqo_glue/src/lib.rs", "netwerk/test/http3server/Cargo.toml", "netwerk/test/http3server/src/main.rs", "supply-chain/audits.toml", "third_party/rust/mtu/.cargo-checksum.json", "third_party/rust/mtu/Cargo.toml", "third_party/rust/mtu/build.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-bin/.cargo-checksum.json", "third_party/rust/neqo-bin/Cargo.toml", "third_party/rust/neqo-bin/benches/main.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-bin/build.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-bin/src/client/http3.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-bin/src/client/mod.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-bin/src/server/mod.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-common/.cargo-checksum.json", "third_party/rust/neqo-common/Cargo.toml", "third_party/rust/neqo-common/benches/decoder.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-common/src/log.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-http3/.cargo-checksum.json", "third_party/rust/neqo-http3/Cargo.toml", "third_party/rust/neqo-http3/benches/common.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-http3/src/client_events.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-http3/src/conn_params.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-http3/src/connect_udp.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-http3/src/connection.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-http3/src/connection_client.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-http3/src/connection_server.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-http3/src/control_stream_local.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-http3/src/features/extended_connect/mod.rs", "third_party/rust/neqo-http3/src/features/extended