ences, the fences could be merged by using sync_merge().\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322514\n", "files": ["gfx/gl/SharedSurfaceAndroidHardwareBuffer.cpp", "gfx/layers/AndroidHardwareBuffer.cpp", "gfx/layers/AndroidHardwareBuffer.h", "toolkit/library/moz.build"], "git_node": "bfadf18dc99367112cbf4cf3581d67abf54fbc13", "git_parents": ["18fcc7221e24754e577e92a5422c282c26b5da52"], "node": "7ae1d423d2e94ce8fc3ae503c136be629dc2f5ee", "parents": ["237e972c387636da9239c229f609ada02253d91e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2059195 - Reject WebRenderScrollData whose referent isn't actually embedded by the sender. r=botond\" for causing mochitest failures at WebRenderBridgeParent\n\nThis reverts commit 440bc0a800c2b9fef5a1931f3562572950ba1a4f.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2059195 - Track each pipeline's embedder LayersId in CompositorBridgeParent::LayerTreeState. r=gfx-reviewers,aosmond\"\n\nThis reverts commit 016dbe1ee1477bf06968f4c30cec58c800be78d2.\n", "files": ["gfx/ipc/GPUProcessManager.cpp", "gfx/ipc/GPUProcessManager.h", "gfx/layers/ipc/CompositorBridgeChild.cpp", "gfx/layers/ipc/CompositorBridgeChild.h", "gfx/layers/ipc/CompositorBridgeParent.cpp", "gfx/layers/ipc/CompositorBridgeParent.h", "gfx/layers/ipc/ContentCompositorBridgeParent.cpp", "gfx/layers/ipc/ContentCompositorBridgeParent.h", "gfx/layers/ipc/PCompositorBridge.ipdl", "gfx/layers/wr/WebRenderBridgeParent.cpp", "gfx/layers/wr/WebRenderScrollData.cpp", "gfx/layers/wr/WebRenderScrollData.h", "layout/ipc/RemoteLayerTreeOwner.cpp"], "git_node": "505553167db634363907dbcf854d11e3e351ca0d", "git_parents": ["bfadf18dc99367112cbf4cf3581d67abf54fbc13"], "node": "e4e061a7035a8eae91c8bf113a509f76ea2e0c5a", "parents": ["7ae1d423d2e94ce8fc3ae503c136be629dc2f5ee"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003cchun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057759 - Test remote decoded color metadata transport r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321679\n", "files": ["dom/media/gtest/TestRemoteImageHolder.cpp"], "git_node": "ff0070161e7d2939d73fde476677c1c858296f41", "git_parents": ["505553167db634363907dbcf854d11e3e351ca0d"], "node": "284992548bf7c234f1e802ec684b82aac959b504", "parents": ["e4e061a7035a8eae91c8bf113a509f76ea2e0c5a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003cchun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057759 - Preserve decoded color metadata across remote image transport r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321680\n", "files": ["dom/media/ipc/RemoteImageHolder.cpp", "dom/media/ipc/RemoteVideoDecoder.cpp", "gfx/layers/ipc/SharedPlanarYCbCrImage.cpp"], "git_node": "d421c372bc19e077c26731be35f1e701a3c3d7e2", "git_parents": ["ff0070161e7d2939d73fde476677c1c858296f41"], "node": "facb2d2ab204b1843eb00a96549268d1927be2a2", "parents": ["284992548bf7c234f1e802ec684b82aac959b504"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003cchun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057759 - Test FFmpeg decoded frame color metadata r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu\n\nGenerate av1-color-metadata.mp4 with:\n  ./generate_color_metadata_video.py av1-color-metadata.mp4\n      --codec libaom-av1 --pixel-format yuv420p10le\n      --color-primaries bt2020 --color-transfer smpte2084\n      --color-matrix bt2020nc --color-range tv --movflags +faststart\n      --encoder-option cpu-used=8 --encoder-option still-picture=1\n      --encoder-option crf=30\n\nThe checked-in fixture was generated with FFmpeg 6.1.1-3ubuntu5.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321982\n", "files": ["dom/media/gtest/TestMediaDataDecoder.cpp", "dom/media/gtest/av1-color-metadata.mp4", "dom/media/gtest/generate_color_metadata_video.py", "dom/media/gtest/moz.build"], "git_node": "c33eae190673e4f23e204c801d1aafc22fc53ac6", "git_parents": ["d421c372bc19e077c26731be35f1e701a3c3d7e2"], "node": "faff2953a2516fb166b92633a76f007835b242a4", "parents": ["facb2d2ab204b1843eb00a96549268d1927be2a2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003cchun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057759 - Preserve FFmpeg decoded frame color metadata r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321681\n", "files": ["dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/FFmpegVideoDecoder.cpp", "dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/FFmpegVideoDecoder.h"], "git_node": "8898eed6d09b1babe13d9c7c9d18d1e9fb56a294", "git_parents": ["c33eae190673e4f23e204c801d1aafc22fc53ac6"], "node": "25562420acee83037ddd76f1b507d8318533fd0e", "parents": ["faff2953a2516fb166b92633a76f007835b242a4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057759: apply code formatting via Lando\n\n# ignore-this-changeset\n", "files": ["dom/media/gtest/TestRemoteImageHolder.cpp"], "git_node": "3090db88d357c0a1274c5f467f2711aea072a8e0", "git_parents": ["8898eed6d09b1babe13d9c7c9d18d1e9fb56a294"], "node": "b711862e4821045641271223a50134837010ab22", "parents": ["25562420acee83037ddd76f1b507d8318533fd0e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "serge-sans-paille \u003csguelton@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065399 - Do not specify inequality operator when not needed r=ipc-reviewers,media-playback-reviewers,profiler-reviewers,win-reviewers,dom-storage-reviewers,gtk-reviewers,emilio,gstoll,nika,asuth,canova,padenot\n\nThe compiler automatically generates a call to !(a==b) when (a!=b) is\nmet and operator!= is not defined, so let's remove useless code.\n\nCases automatically detected by an extension to the linter from Bug 2064388, also included in that patch.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320346\n", "files": ["accessible/base/AccAttributes.h", "build/clang-plugin/DefaultEqualChecker.cpp", "build/clang-plugin/tests/TestDefaultEqual.cpp", "docshell/base/BrowsingContext.h", "dom/canvas/WebGLTypes.h", "dom/indexedDB/SafeRefPtr.h", "dom/media/VideoUtils.h", "dom/media/doctor/RollingNumber.h", "dom/media/platforms/agnostic/AOMDecoder.h", "dom/smil/SMILMilestone.h", "editor/libeditor/HTMLEditor.h", "gfx/2d/ScaleFactors2D.h", "gfx/2d/Types.h", "gfx/layers/LayersTypes.h", "gfx/thebes/gfxTypes.h", "image/FrameTimeout.h", "image/Orientation.h", "image/Resolution.h", "intl/components/src/ICU4CGlue.h", "intl/components/src/Locale.h", "intl/components/src/NumberPart.h", "ipc/glue/ProtocolUtils.h", "js/public/ColumnNumber.h", "js/public/HeapAPI.h", "js/public/Id.h", "js/public/RegExpFlags.h", "js/public/UbiNode.h", "js/public/Value.h", "js/src/ds/LifoAlloc.h", "js/src/ds/SlimLinkedList.h", "js/src/frontend/NameAnalysisTypes.h", "js/src/frontend/ParseNode.h", "js/src/frontend/ParserAtom.h", "js/src/frontend/SharedContext.h", "js/src/gc/StoreBuffer.h", "js/src/irregexp/util/ZoneShim.h", "js/src/jit/CacheIRCompiler.h", "js/src/jit/InlineList.h", "js/src/jit/IonTypes.h", "js/src/jit/LIR.h", "js/src/jsapi-tests/testJitRValueAlloc.cpp", "js/src/util/EnumFlags.h", "js/src/vm/BindingKind.h", "js/src/vm/NativeObject.h", "js/src/vm/PropMap.h", "js/src/vm/PropertyInfo.h", "js/src/vm/Stack.h", "js/src/vm/TaggedProto.h", "js/src/wasm/WasmAnyRef.h", "js/src/wasm/WasmBinary.h", "js/src/wasm/WasmGC.h", "mfbt/BitSet.h", "mfbt/Char16.h", "mfbt/DoublyLinkedList.h", "mfbt/EnumSet.h", "mfbt/EnumeratedRange.h", "mfbt/IntegerRange.h", "mfbt/LinkedList.h", "mfbt/Opaque.h", "mfbt/Saturate.h", "mozglue/baseprofiler/public/BaseProfilerUtils.h", "mozglue/misc/WindowsDiagnostics.h", "toolkit/components/protobuf/src/google/protobuf/generated_message_util.h", "tools/profiler/core/ProfileBufferEntry.h", "tools/rewriting/ThirdPartyPaths.txt", "widget/IMEData.h", "widget/TextEvents.h", "widget/gtk/nsLookAndFeel.h", "widget/windows/WinHeaderOnlyUtils.h", "widget/windows/WindowHook.h", "widget/windows/nsWindow.h", "xpcom/base/nsCycleCollector.cpp", "xpcom/tests/gtest/TestSmallArrayLRUCache.cpp"], "git_node": "e68e3aea285eff3e212c7582168be03747437caa", "git_parents": ["3090db88d357c0a1274c5f467f2711aea072a8e0"], "node": "bf31683c17b181efff07c4c1630c7a52d8e76028", "parents": ["b711862e4821045641271223a50134837010ab22"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lars Eggert \u003clars@eggert.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067704 Use std::is_permutation in different_rrset() r=valentin,necko-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322330\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/nsHostResolver.cpp"], "git_node": "3bd3837276cc29d76085089569035ae08668165e", "git_parents": ["e68e3aea285eff3e212c7582168be03747437caa"], "node": "b1cbe2e8e4eca490ed107d9f08cb0a4262363ab5", "parents": ["bf31683c17b181efff07c4c1630c7a52d8e76028"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Calixte Denizet \u003ccalixte.denizet@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067159 - Isolate root prefs for concurrent xpcshell harness runs. r=ahal\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321896\n", "files": ["testing/xpcshell/runxpcshelltests.py"], "git_node": "ce9726d8e85e4e13273b95d480fdedb92b38c951", "git_parents": ["3bd3837276cc29d76085089569035ae08668165e"], "node": "ca0e940fe2d11ce3f2eda62040cb5aacac5cfbf1", "parents": ["b1cbe2e8e4eca490ed107d9f08cb0a4262363ab5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "mayankleoboy1 \u003cmayankleoboy1@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067346 - Inflate Latin-1 in bulk when appending to a two-byte StringBuilder. r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nAppending Latin-1 characters to a two-byte buffer went through\nVector::append, whose element-wise copyConstruct does not vectorize.\ninflateChars already uses mozilla::ConvertLatin1toUtf16 for the same\nconversion; route the append paths through it too. ConvertLatin1toUtf16 has\nan inline scalar path below kShortStringLimitForInlinePaths, so short\nappends do not pay for the call.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322039\n", "files": ["js/src/util/StringBuilder.h"], "git_node": "6339260d40d65a0d5e87297271b434e3f42a58e1", "git_parents": ["ce9726d8e85e4e13273b95d480fdedb92b38c951"], "node": "2e90c8a1455695e1c260523a25d12b4461431ad4", "parents": ["ca0e940fe2d11ce3f2eda62040cb5aacac5cfbf1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067030 - Don't dispose enclosing scope's resources when leaving a for-of loop. r=arai\n\nWhen a for-of loop's head had no lexical declaration of its own (eg `for (x of y)`),\nleaving the loop via break/continue/return incorrectly disposed the resources of\nthe scope enclosing the loop.\n\nIn `ForOfLoopControl::emitIteratorCloseForNonLocalExits` we now use the same condition\nas `emitEndCodeNeedingIteratorClose`.\n\nThis also adds a number of tests, some failed without this patch. We now match a\nV8 shell for all of these cases.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321815\n", "files": ["js/src/frontend/EmitterScope.h", "js/src/frontend/ForOfLoopControl.cpp", "js/src/frontend/UsingEmitter.cpp", "js/src/jit-test/tests/explicit-resource-management/for-of-non-local-exit-async.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/explicit-resource-management/for-of-non-local-exit-module.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/explicit-resource-management/for-of-non-local-exit.js"], "git_node": "5b1f28f7804fd2a271b748186317f4ac2ba710fb", "git_parents": ["6339260d40d65a0d5e87297271b434e3f42a58e1"], "node": "410380820b39bfb38072385ed40b776d252a6e55", "parents": ["2e90c8a1455695e1c260523a25d12b4461431ad4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julian Descottes \u003cjdescottes@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1988868 - [devtools] Add DAMP test for inspector layout panel with many grid containers r=perftest-reviewers,devtools-reviewers,aglavic,ochameau\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321556\n", "files": ["testing/talos/talos/tests/devtools/addon/content/tests/inspector/layout.js"], "git_node": "18007e5708513df72f55f977d04c7a3a31275cab", "git_parents": ["5b1f28f7804fd2a271b748186317f4ac2ba710fb"], "node": "d1a163d6664fa8645ac83b7c9a06d848c13731e5", "parents": ["410380820b39bfb38072385ed40b776d252a6e55"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julian Descottes \u003cjdescottes@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1988868 - [devtools] Improve performance of layout panel on pages with many grid elements r=devtools-reviewers,devtools-backward-compat-reviewers,ochameau\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D264256\n", "files": ["devtools/client/fronts/layout.js", "devtools/client/inspector/grids/actions/grids.js", "devtools/client/inspector/grids/grid-inspector.js", "devtools/client/inspector/grids/reducers/grids.js", "devtools/client/inspector/grids/types.js", "devtools/client/inspector/rules/views/text-property-editor.js", "devtools/server/actors/layout.js", "devtools/server/actors/root.js", "devtools/server/tests/browser/browser_layout_getGrids.js", "devtools/shared/specs/layout.js"], "git_node": "57da0db2b2972e59c0face35f7d2188ad545bc8b", "git_parents": ["18007e5708513df72f55f977d04c7a3a31275cab"], "node": "0fa16a70e8d7487521719b08ac77fddcbb758eab", "parents": ["d1a163d6664fa8645ac83b7c9a06d848c13731e5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE\n\nach -\u003e 0b0d7ba32263c7ce2331dd8a5c0613ea39b68a82\naf -\u003e 0b0d7ba32263c7ce2331dd8a5c0613ea39b68a82\nan -\u003e 0b0d7ba32263c7ce2331dd8a5c0613ea39b68a82\nar -\u003e 0b0d7ba32263c7ce2331dd8a5c0613ea39b68a82\nast -\u003e 0b0d7ba32263c7ce2331dd8a5c0613ea39b68a82\naz -\u003e 0b0d7ba32263c7ce2331dd8a5c0613ea39b68a82\nbe -\u003e 0b0d7ba32263c7ce2331dd8a5c0613ea39b68a82\nbg -\u003e 0b0d7ba32263c