only\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nLinear PredefinedColorSpaces: Add context attributes tests\n\nAdd tests for getContextAttributes, and that the context's value is the\ndefault for getImageData.\n\nBug: 454152417\nChange-Id: I09413df6910f52e196965088c6ff5687fc45108b\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8305813\nCommit-Queue: ccameron chromium \u003cccameron@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Philip Rogers \u003cpdr@chromium.org\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1687545}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 8c1ff46708357ec32bfa7e231be18cfdc7127125\nwpt-pr: 62249\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/element/manual/context-attributes/getContextAttributes.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/element/manual/wide-gamut-canvas/canvas-color-space-settings.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/element/manual/wide-gamut-canvas/canvas-display-p3-settings.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/context-attributes/getContextAttributes.html"], "git_node": "3ef74e7269680d0042eac272ea5b962666d258d5", "git_parents": ["19d49c56b6dafaf7ea7acb5c074f940bf77eb9b9"], "node": "4e26aedbf42a2d71d1791792c20fc99d7c74df7a", "parents": ["d8c8eb24069ef6d6cd0395eb2264c437f27ff20e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067668 [wpt PR 62249] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62249\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/html/canvas/element/manual/context-attributes/getContextAttributes.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/canvas/element/manual/wide-gamut-canvas/canvas-color-space-settings.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/canvas/element/manual/wide-gamut-canvas/canvas-display-p3-settings.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/canvas/offscreen/manual/context-attributes/getContextAttributes.html.ini"], "git_node": "d971c1c6c3b9fa3be1aba69e687bbd7a41a96bf7", "git_parents": ["3ef74e7269680d0042eac272ea5b962666d258d5"], "node": "e29b8e44d37df01ba18dd905c2455a60e02d134f", "parents": ["4e26aedbf42a2d71d1791792c20fc99d7c74df7a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Javier Contreras \u003cjaviercon@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066932 [wpt PR 62225] - [gap-decorations] Support assignment for reversed flex fragments, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[gap-decorations] Support assignment for reversed flex fragments\n\nThis CL extends the accessor path used by unfragmented reversals so that\nit can be used for fragmented reversals. CL:8248120.\n\nReversed flex gap-decoration values were assigned using fragment-local\ngap indices. A gap that continued into another fragment could therefore\nrestart the value list or use the wrong value from that list.\n\nPreserve placement-order indices across fragmentation. Main gaps use\ntheir stitched container index. For cross gaps, layout records the\ndecoration index and we use that with the existing random-access value\naccessor.\n\nA follow up change will get rid of the iterator path entirely, since the\nperf runs showed no regression:\nhttps://pinpoint-dot-chromeperf.appspot.com/job/121450a3a90000\n\nThe follow up change also will improve the API from the painter's\nperspective to abstract away container specific logic.\n\nBug: 357648037\nChange-Id: I69cc881f0c00bf23c4b06517258288ce5ea3879e\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8287178\nReviewed-by: Ian Kilpatrick \u003cikilpatrick@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Javier Contreras \u003cjaviercon@microsoft.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Kurt Catti-Schmidt \u003ckschmi@microsoft.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1686705}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 7c43ce83772f413b76285fa52ed8d5c4b64757c1\nwpt-pr: 62225\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-031-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-031.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-032-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-032.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-033-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-033.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-034-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-034.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-035-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-035.html"], "git_node": "26a36301b4f1d74187d57fc8b769fdcb68cfb334", "git_parents": ["d971c1c6c3b9fa3be1aba69e687bbd7a41a96bf7"], "node": "64c76d277ec94ab8c4b89be072455857e90ad5f9", "parents": ["e29b8e44d37df01ba18dd905c2455a60e02d134f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066932 [wpt PR 62225] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62225\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-022-crash.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-031.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-032.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-033.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-034.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-gaps/flex/fragmentation/flex-gap-decorations-fragmentation-035.html.ini"], "git_node": "9fae2bf1def4e23d8b8f906d53007448b2dc2d05", "git_parents": ["26a36301b4f1d74187d57fc8b769fdcb68cfb334"], "node": "986c4f12b044b6eb63ee032e4f5a0c39d5164c87", "parents": ["64c76d277ec94ab8c4b89be072455857e90ad5f9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kurt Catti-Schmidt \u003ckschmi@microsoft.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067670 [wpt PR 62250] - [grid] Fix is_fixed_container value in grid, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[grid] Fix is_fixed_container value in grid\n\nWe are setting a variable named \"is_fixed_container\" to\nnode.IsAbsoluteContainer(), even though there's a variable right above\nit that's named \"is_absolute_container\" set to the same value.\n\nThis was introduced in [1], and was likely a mistake in the revert.\n\nThis change sets the value to node.IsFixedContainer() and adds a WPT\nthat passes in Firefox and fails in main without the change.\n\n1. https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/4833670\n\nChange-Id: I2e7d954c8581735a315743f172d417a501fcadfd\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8301192\nReviewed-by: Alison Maher \u003calmaher@microsoft.com\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Kurt Catti-Schmidt \u003ckschmi@microsoft.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1687634}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 3715d2657cdcf96a4ba0c849d643569891ddb9c1\nwpt-pr: 62250\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-grid/abspos/grid-fixedpos-static-position-not-containing-block-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-grid/abspos/grid-fixedpos-static-position-not-containing-block.html"], "git_node": "c03169cd1447c2cd685fa962d19d3b28065ef722", "git_parents": ["9fae2bf1def4e23d8b8f906d53007448b2dc2d05"], "node": "98375fa10fa89ced5df118acfd7ee72bc213bd5c", "parents": ["986c4f12b044b6eb63ee032e4f5a0c39d5164c87"], "tags": []}, {"author": "moz-wptsync-bot \u003cwptsync@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067670 [wpt PR 62250] - Update wpt metadata, a=testonly\n\nwpt-pr: 62250\nwpt-type: metadata\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-grid/abspos/abspos-in-flexbox-in-grid-crash.html.ini"], "git_node": "21a0584aa0fd00eaa843d969888a4a39cfb1b2f2", "git_parents": ["c03169cd1447c2cd685fa962d19d3b28065ef722"], "node": "0ae8947bafa1098663af5333931056ae10e8fae5", "parents": ["98375fa10fa89ced5df118acfd7ee72bc213bd5c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Stephen McGruer \u003csmcgruer@chromium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067671 [wpt PR 62248] - Consolidate Payment Method Manifest WPT Link header tests, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\nConsolidate Payment Method Manifest WPT Link header tests\n\nConsolidate the Link header test suite from 11 separate files down to 3\nlogically grouped files:\n\n  - link-header-parsing.https.window.js: Groups RFC 8288 parsing rules\n    including unquoted rel values, space-separated rel tokens, ASCII\n    case insensitivity, additional parameters, comma-separated targets,\n    and multiple Link header entries.\n  - link-header-selection.https.window.js: Groups manifest selection\n    rules including basic success, missing Link header, incorrect rel\n    attribute, and duplicate manifest link aborts.\n  - link-header-non-https.https.sub.window.js: Retained as a dedicated\n    test for non-HTTPS manifest target rejection requiring multi-port\n    substitution.\n\nAlso updates the Chromium test expectation baselines (-expected.txt)\nfor the consolidated files.\n\nBug: 552832440\nChange-Id: Id71944f7fd3f0e6f12e5acfb204c3baa080de132\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8297921\nCommit-Queue: Xuehui Chen \u003cxuehuichen@google.com\u003e\nReviewed-by: Xuehui Chen \u003cxuehuichen@google.com\u003e\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1687632}\n\n--\n\nwpt-commits: 993e7fb3ed0d64049f242d4f63448a03ba583924\nwpt-pr: 62248\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-basic-success.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-case-insensitive-rel.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-missing.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-multiple-links.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-multiple-manifest-links.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-multiple-rel.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-parsing.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-selection.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-space-separated-rel.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-unquoted-rel.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-with-parameters.https.window.js", "testing/web-platform/tests/payment-method-manifest/link-header-wrong-rel.https.window.js"], "git_node": "bfc0c583c344e9b9aaa1304d1f901d734e4cd330", "git_parents": ["21a0584aa0fd00eaa843d969888a4a39cfb1b2f2"], "node": "b8765b00932d3fd7af1f8bfc7a4b4d1668257ba0", "parents": ["0ae8947bafa1098663af5333931056ae10e8fae5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tim Nguyen \u003cnt1m@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067699 [wpt PR 62246] - [css-overflow] Move text-overflow tests in css-ui to css-overflow, a=testonly\n\nAutomatic update from web-platform-tests\n[css-overflow] Move text-overflow tests in css-ui to css-overflow (#62246)\n--\n\nwpt-commits: d90036ed5dea4562e92f146018665a2f9564e034\nwpt-pr: 62246\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-overflow/WEB_FEATURES.yml", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-overflow/crashtests/WEB_FEATURES.yml", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-overflow/crashtests/text-overflow-ellipsis-multiline-crash.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/