/too-large limit in Iterator.prototype.{take,drop}. r=dminor\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321280\n", "files": ["js/public/friend/ErrorNumbers.msg", "js/src/builtin/Iterator.js"], "git_node": "7a31e3b542ba060db170e918fe902d68d71eb690", "git_parents": ["e8d0e0a95c96f680b25bb9570117729cfd6c7d4d"], "node": "ed87a07f9680d6078245d26902c5d3e4acae295d", "parents": ["213dbbd4d0dc3ecadbe7b61dae895578b4915788"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Cornelius Emase \u003ccorneliuslochipi@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062666 - Part 2: Update spec step comments in Iterator.prototype.take/drop to match current numbering. r=dminor\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321281\n", "files": ["js/src/builtin/Iterator.js"], "git_node": "2f6fcd0808e736765eb5758fbaadaecd82205d7e", "git_parents": ["7a31e3b542ba060db170e918fe902d68d71eb690"], "node": "8dfc892ac392c8c59e8b2ccd2504dcaa32ec836d", "parents": ["ed87a07f9680d6078245d26902c5d3e4acae295d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Cornelius Emase \u003ccorneliuslochipi@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062666 - Part 3: Remove skip entries for Iterator.prototype.take/drop RangeError tests. r=dminor\n\nParts 1 and 2 have fixed the RangeError and spec step comment\nissues, the six test262 tests that were temporarily skipped can be\nre-enabled at this point.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321666\n", "files": ["js/src/tests/jstests.list"], "git_node": "d04a0264bd679af2d9d2e3f234e7991649b97f4e", "git_parents": ["2f6fcd0808e736765eb5758fbaadaecd82205d7e"], "node": "464b6df6067312adc660db1c0a0f14409feac59b", "parents": ["8dfc892ac392c8c59e8b2ccd2504dcaa32ec836d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jon Coppeard \u003cjcoppeard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068387 - Clear list of cells to check are not marked gray if we can't check them r=spidermonkey-reviewers,dminor\n\nIf the gray marking state is not valid we can't check these cells. We still\nneed to clear the list though.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323274\n", "files": ["js/src/gc/Sweeping.cpp", "js/src/jit-test/tests/gc/bug-2068387.js"], "git_node": "559ee6c1707ab1f9af7ce5a0540ef8b44dfac057", "git_parents": ["d04a0264bd679af2d9d2e3f234e7991649b97f4e"], "node": "35cee3b8c58ca5e7815300754a9ca86e61a11230", "parents": ["464b6df6067312adc660db1c0a0f14409feac59b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jon Coppeard \u003cjcoppeard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068394 - Set gray marking state to invalid after clearing all mark bits for pre barrier verification r=spidermonkey-reviewers,dminor\n\nThe testcase demonstrates how we can get into an invalid gray marking state\nafter pre-barrier verification has cleared all mark bits. Update the verifier\nto set gray marking state to invalid at the start rather than at the end.\n\nThis also does a drive-by change to make the verifier to use UniquePtr for the\ntracer rather than new/delete.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323270\n", "files": ["js/src/gc/Verifier.cpp", "js/src/jit-test/tests/gc/bug-2068394.js"], "git_node": "d44c96a3f96cf00021ee72809285f180c47ea39d", "git_parents": ["559ee6c1707ab1f9af7ce5a0540ef8b44dfac057"], "node": "335bbcb8609710c025e582e5c2d35074ac5875b6", "parents": ["35cee3b8c58ca5e7815300754a9ca86e61a11230"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Eitan Isaacson \u003ceitan@monotonous.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1804714 - Expose \u003csummary\u003e in Android correctly. r=Jamie,geckoview-reviewers,tcampbell\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322450\n", "files": ["accessible/android/TraversalRule.cpp", "accessible/base/RoleMap.inc", "dom/locales/en-US/chrome/accessibility/AccessFu.properties", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/test/AccessibilityTest.kt"], "git_node": "e03fc8bd6bcb87ce5ba7674e63261b0