mach vendor` r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323757\n", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/vendor/vendor_manifest.py"], "git_node": "3d649d92e0eaed2e4de84bafbc0fa2b4cf1c4936", "git_parents": ["3c233c51eb26ff7d23f8c62537d72097c6c1a97c"], "node": "8791b79f5db2a7a75337b34b17668a49daa09e70", "parents": ["2a054cd6c26f95ccdf4cce61a12f11137923650b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Brad Werth \u003cbwerth@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068335: Only allow capture requests from the root WebRender bridge. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\nContent processes should never request this, and if they were allowed,\na compromised content process could trigger large disk writes (to a\npredefined, safe location).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323111\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/wr/WebRenderBridgeParent.cpp"], "git_node": "998347794ad657be90b66de9a87315aea9d50575", "git_parents": ["3d649d92e0eaed2e4de84bafbc0fa2b4cf1c4936"], "node": "1b524e1e00a4af39d8aab4e5988a564b283b49d6", "parents": ["8791b79f5db2a7a75337b34b17668a49daa09e70"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Brad Werth \u003cbwerth@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2029831: Make CreateBackendIndependentTextureHost return a readable dummy buffer under memory pressure. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\nMemory pressure can make the shmem passed to\nCreateBackendIndependentTextureHost unmappable. In this case, returning\nnullptr will lead to a crash of the parent process. This patch instead\nreturns a dummy texture host that can be safely resolved.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323044\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/composite/TextureHost.cpp"], "git_node": "3945ab22dd637e70825258c53d94e116152855c1", "git_parents": ["998347794ad657be90b66de9a87315aea9d50575"], "node": "e477d4818642324aea1dfe7fce55a613d5ea8938", "parents": ["1b524e1e00a4af39d8aab4e5988a564b283b49d6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062903 - Don't allow system principal in ContentParent::RecvGetClipboardDataSnapshot; r=tschuster\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319200\n", "files": ["accessible/tests/browser/text/head.js", "dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp", "widget/tests/clipboard_helper.js", "widget/tests/file_test_clipboard_getDataSnapshot.js", "widget/tests/test_clipboard_getDataSnapshot.html", "widget/tests/test_clipboard_getDataSnapshotSync.html"], "git_node": "9a1f5a0e0028433280890b9ce294ecc18c48cf79", "git_parents": ["3945ab22dd637e70825258c53d94e116152855c1"], "node": "44e3bf9f0f01be62bf434e0f96d68ba4608b292c", "parents": ["e477d4818642324aea1dfe7fce55a613d5ea8938"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068880 - Skip the persisted search terms lookup outside the address bar. r=jteow\n\nRefocusing the search bar threw before autoOpen could requery due to unguarded attempt to access gBrowser.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323266\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/content/UrlbarView.mjs", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-newtab/browser_mousedown.js"], "git_node": "9c33c4129c829e435ee9971aed2514fcc9ed502b", "git_parents": ["9a1f5a0e0028433280890b9ce294ecc18c48cf79"], "node": "e6b728f9038675513572ca6ef04abbb632176055", "parents": ["44e3bf9f0f01be62bf434e0f96d68ba4608b292c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069382 - Build the urlbar view row gutter out of padding rather than a transparent border. r=adw\n\nA border width snaps to whole device pixels and padding does not, so rows grow by the difference: 1px in chrome and 1.5px in New Tab at a device pixel ratio of 1, and 0.5px in New Tab at 2, where chrome's gutter is already integral. Everything else holds across normal, compact and touch density and across plain, rich-search, tip and realtime rows, with two exceptions to check: a tip's background now spans the full row, flush with the tip's separator, and a realtime item's hit area is now its pill rather than the pill plus a gutter.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323732\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/urlbar/view-nova.css"], "git_node": "aa5446f043a0caac42d9e3cbef446ae846831373", "git_parents": ["9c33c4129c829e435ee9971aed2514fcc9ed502b"], "node": "780c52f89cd1223235b9743180a3dee71838ad27", "parents": ["e6b728f9038675513572ca6ef04abbb632176055"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059631 - Add test for filtering unknow format (bug 2057130); r=tschuster\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315517\n", "files": ["dom/base/test/gtest/TestContentUtils.cpp"], "git_node": "85fb0961787b87620e3f34a10d3f2e50422c3f5c", "git_parents": ["aa5446f043a0caac42d9e3cbef446ae846831373"], "node": "c2f6c65c44c5b1c5d50a6b10c781eed1b48bb78d", "parents": ["780c52f89cd1223235b9743180a3dee71838ad27"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rolf Rando \u003crrando@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069173 - Update ML model version if user has a model version pref change while browser is running r=dimi\n\nFixes a small bug noticed when looking at the experiment telemetry\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323436\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/formautofill/metrics.yaml", "toolkit/components/formautofill/shared/FormAutofillML.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "8f4698ed3c997bb8cef02ad9b0c20f84f407b722", "git_parents": ["85fb0961787b87620e3f34a10d3f2e50422c3f5c"], "node": "6e4c287ace8e15a4dd6d4399fef529c2eeeaacb0", "parents": ["c2f6c65c44c5b1c5d50a6b10c781eed1b48bb78d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Matthew Tighe \u003cmatthewdtighe@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067128 - Add basic voice popup list to debug drawer 