fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/SettingsTurnOnSyncPage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/ShareOverlayPage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/TabDrawerPage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/TabHistoryPage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/ToolbarComponent.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/UnifiedTrustPanelPage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/WebCompatReporterPage.kt"], "git_node": "c0637ac74f3a5e0865f221a884ab7bc7fd807f7d", "git_parents": ["8924026f261a11a6b923337a2274f403c6254fd1"], "node": "d395b7afe78b74d665b98236a6bc84b153f32a48", "parents": ["45a02272936841b81db812b500d5ae89c003e58a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jackie Johnson \u003cjajohnson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065120 - [efficiency] Unify UI wait and failure contracts. r=aaronmt\n\nRoute selector, collection, state, page-readiness, and action-bounded retries through shared fresh-observation semantics. Record the configured deadline, attempts, elapsed time, final observation, selector backend and role, screen, and active navigation edge without caching UI snapshots.\n\nKeep absence distinct from unsupported and resolver failures, surface predicate and condition exceptions, and replace the UiObject2 always-visible oracle with a live bounds check. Retain the non-sensitive diagnostic fields in provider-portable attempt evidence.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323475\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/core/ElementState.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/core/UiElement.kt", "mo