ferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320779\n", "files": ["layout/base/nsLayoutUtils.cpp", "layout/base/tests/mochitest.toml", "layout/base/tests/test_keyboard_scroll_from_fixed_pos.html"], "git_node": "90a452849d4e3923ba036885330006993bc9c999", "git_parents": ["6843e58baaee04286807f899b0855bf2358a5dbd"], "node": "3eecdf45685c310700ed976b55b239c8cff0f40a", "parents": ["060899ee5c8df4c1b7d311f48d4f3452d14bb165"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067605 - Enable the Merino client for fetching curated recommendations in Nightly r=android-reviewers,skhan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322191\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/nimbus.fml.yaml"], "git_node": "5ba644a7e6cc4eeb991db953ea1705c797b2d3e8", "git_parents": ["90a452849d4e3923ba036885330006993bc9c999"], "node": "60988f2ff9cc61a3e32f18e35764f3c43f5b076d", "parents": ["3eecdf45685c310700ed976b55b239c8cff0f40a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Reem H \u003c42309026+reemhamz@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059851 - Create accessible label for customize menu's subpanel back buttons. r=fluent-reviewers,Dre,bolsson\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323451\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/CustomizeMenu/SectionsMgmtPanel/SectionsMgmtPanel.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/CustomizeMenu/ThemesManagementPanel/ThemesManagementPanel.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/CustomizeMenu/_CustomizeMenu.scss", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Nova/CustomizeMenu/WidgetsManagementPanel/WidgetsManagementPanel.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/WallpaperCategories/WallpaperCategories.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/WallpaperCategories/_WallpaperCategories.scss", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/CustomizeMenu/SectionsMgmtPanel.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/CustomizeMenu/ThemesManagementPanel.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Nova/CustomizeMenu/WidgetsManagementPanel/WidgetsManagementPanel.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/WallpaperCategories/WallpaperCategories.test.jsx", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/newtab/newtab.ftl"], "git_node": "aeb130f65fd813b13d2364d2b451f2d6f3d56cc7", "git_parents": ["5ba644a7e6cc4eeb991db953ea1705c797b2d3e8"], "node": "f4a12ab02e31ecf30af6871722cd0f3b7b02486d", "parents": ["60988f2ff9cc61a3e32f18e35764f3c43f5b076d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-central repo-update remote-settings tld-suffixes mobile-experiments ct-logs - r=release-managers,dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323928\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/raw/initial_experiments.json", "netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/newtab-wallpapers-v2.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": "9d4ff88c1db2e082f8c879f6a91afd62eab393f9", "git_parents": ["aeb130f65fd813b13d2364d2b451f2d6f3d56cc7"], "node": "23d6f621df491ff3e88839e3598ce54c22cdc60a", "parents": ["f4a12ab02e31ecf30af6871722cd0f3b7b02486d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nina Pypchenko \u003cnpypchenko@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2060731 - Widgets that show content in an iframe appear blank while being dragged on New Tab r=fchasen\n\nWidget reordering on New Tab no longer uses HTML drag and drop. The row follows\nthe pointer directly and moves the widget itself, so a widget that draws its\ncontent in an iframe keeps rendering all the way through the drag instead of\ngoing blank. Only the widget being dragged changes how it moves: the animation\nthat slides the others into place is the one added in bug 2049472, reused as is.\nThat file is untouched, though its React wrapper now has no callers and could be\nremoved separately.\n\nTwo behaviours change as a side effect, both deliberate. Releasing a widget over\na gap between widgets, or outside the row, now keeps the position shown on\nscreen instead of snapping back; Escape is the only way to cancel. Reordering by\ntouch is no longer possible, which previously worked on Windows alone through an\nundocumented double tap and drag.\n\nA browser test for reordering was written and is not included here. It passes,\nbut every browser test finishes with a check that the compositor has gone idle,\nand merely rendering the widgets row keeps it awake. That happens with no drag\nat all, so it is a pre-existing problem rather than something this patch\nintroduces, and it is being filed separately.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316450\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/Widgets.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/_Widgets.scss", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/useMouseDnD.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/components/Widgets/useWidgetDnD.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/lib/usePointerReorder.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/karma.mc.config.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/components/Widgets/useWidgetDnD.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/content-src/lib/usePointerReorder.test.jsx", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/jest-setup.mjs"], "git_node": "7746ca6db107ae6778332d45eaf6fe4b927ed6bc", "git_parents": ["9d4ff88c1db2e082f8c879f6a91afd62eab393f9"], "node": "a8a1a3498bd803a8481e34e3df65226b986a4ec3", "parents": ["23d6f621df491ff3e88839e3598ce54c22cdc60a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068859 - Add top sites filtering to the homescreen blocklist r=android-reviewers,npoon\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323170\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/blocklist/BlocklistHandler.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/blocklist/BlocklistHandlerTest.kt"], "git_node": "032a849ce0a8e4bb913883f9a576711de145bcbe", "git_parents": ["7746ca6db107ae6778332d45eaf6fe4b927ed6bc"], "node": "5d4b741a1368e2a13009cb29b3b61c1cec592d01", "parents": ["a8a1a3498bd803a8481e34e3df65226b986a4ec3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gabriel Luong \u003cgabriel.luong@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069049 - Remove Firefox default shortcut experiment r=android-reviewers,npoon\n\n- Removes the firefox-jp-guide-default-site Nimbus feature and related settings and shortcut entry.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323325\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/nimbus.fml.yaml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/compose/ThumbnailImage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/DefaultTopSitesBinding.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/TopSitesFavicon.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/utils/Settings.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/ic_japan_onboarding_favicon.webp", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/raw/initial_shortcuts.json", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/home/topsites/DefaultTopSitesBindingTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/resources/raw/test_initial_shortcuts.json"], "git_node": "cd3059db1a667e4bb0bbd7e1c55da555b15c6102", "git_parents": ["032a849ce0a8e4bb913883f9a576711de145bcbe"], "node": "5dcc8159e54adcfe2e8fe04cf7dc8526f9032d09", "parents"