Revert \"Bug 2060247 - Default SpeechRecognition.lang to the document's content language. r=dom-core-reviewers,smaug\"\n\nThis reverts commit bb1d098ac6a1ab71316e3cc1490b3485093790fc.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2060247 - Add a WPT for SpeechRecognition.available() with an invalid language tag. r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu\"\n\nThis reverts commit 01f30a74ce1c23132734c5f1a5d58be5df7e8b88.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2060247 - Don't compile the new test on Android.\"\n\nThis reverts commit 6dfab33b32ae0d45bf8ba87ac3fc886c89061177.\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsDocumentWarningList.inc", "dom/locales/en-US/chrome/dom/dom.properties", "dom/media/docs/SpeechRecognition.md", "dom/media/gtest/TestSpeechModelMapping.cpp", "dom/media/gtest/moz.build", "dom/media/webspeech/recognition/SpeechRecognition.cpp", "dom/media/webspeech/recognition/SpeechRecognitionModelMapping.cpp", "dom/media/webspeech/recognition/SpeechRecognitionModelMapping.h", "dom/media/webspeech/recognition/SpeechRecognitionParent.cpp", "dom/media/webspeech/recognition/SpeechRecognitionParent.h", "dom/media/webspeech/recognition/gen_speech_models.py", "dom/media/webspeech/recognition/models.yaml", "dom/media/webspeech/recognition/test/mochitest.toml", "dom/media/webspeech/recognition/test/test_parakeet_multilingual.html", "dom/media/webspeech/recognition/test/test_unsupported_language.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/speech-api/SpeechRecognition-availableOnDevice.https.html", "toolkit/components/ml/docs/HWInference.md"], "git_node": "fec6b7c5bb94112d38a27515b0c725e2c4133b71", "git_parents": ["2b98b2dbf4d941dd41959c593d46aacee977f334"], "node": "b04c9b14c7727cdfa5cba9117ff15d5f2c8f9c16", "parents": ["4a6f397909e3b409cbf605559d9450997b1edc59"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Titouan Thibaud \u003ctthibaud@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069487 - Fix crash caused by missing File Picker when user picks the downloads location. r=android-reviewers,android-l10n-reviewers,giorga,parker\n\nDifferential Revision: https://pha