sets": [{"author": "Nikki Sharpley \u003cnsharpley@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067992 - Show correct sign in and sync state buttons for signed out user r=desktop-theme-reviewers,fluent-reviewers,hjones,bolsson,sync-reviewers,skhamis\n\nFor the sign in button:\n- never signed in before - should show the sign in promo in both account and app menu (unless the app menu has a banner, in which case show a quieter sign in button)\n- signed out - show sign in button next to \"Sign in to sync, You\u2019re signed out\" text\n- not verified/configured - show sign in button next to email and error state\n\nFor the sync status button:\n- never signed in before - \"Sync Your Data\" button\n- signed out/not verified - \"Sync is Off, Sign in to sync\" button\n- signed in and sync is off - \"Sync is Off, Your data isn\u2019t syncing\" text next to \"Turn On\" button\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323402\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/appmenu-viewcache.inc.xhtml", "browser/base/content/browser-sync.js", "browser/base/content/test/sync/browser_contextmenu_sendpage.js", "browser/base/content/test/sync/browser_contextmenu_sendtab.js", "browser/base/content/test/sync/browser_sync.js", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/sync.ftl", "browser/themes/shared/customizableui/panelUI-shared.css"], "git_node": "eca98b505f254ea1d3a6e1af8765bcaad59dc4f1", "git_parents": ["95b8372779aca17e1d24658e886eaf4644b53814"], "node": "752fbfab25bff4b0a3909ffb5316bd77c244ac4e", "parents": ["a093d32a3d8b76ee7dc20fe7fe0891f2ec5b97c4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andreas Farre \u003cfarre@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1922677 - Rate limit every navigation. r=smaug,zcorpan,firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D300744\n", "files": ["docshell/base/BrowsingContext.cpp", "docshell/base/BrowsingContext.h", "docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp", "docshell/base/nsDocShell.h", 