"parents": ["64860ab6c375d9d45fb4b66379874a10d02f74c7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kelly Cochrane \u003ckcochrane@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057571 - Update 'List all tabs' button icon when vertical tabs are enabled r=desktop-theme-reviewers,tabbrowser-reviewers,sfoster\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324414\n", "files": ["browser/components/extensions/test/browser/browser_ext_tabs_hide.js", "browser/themes/shared/icons/search-tabs.svg", "browser/themes/shared/jar.inc.mn", "browser/themes/shared/tabbrowser/tabs.css"], "git_node": "b2d4d3ed20ee79fbef0a9c389fcc4b4a32253a41", "git_parents": ["03035e4a00e6c1659dd2c98507d97213f9d2387f"], "node": "68b75800848dfd3fda9b81d9c9935213ed47cc7a", "parents": ["f785b047a759e5fce500af6d3576d283832650e1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dustin Whisman \u003cdwhisman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2037111 - Rename tab tokens for naming consistency r=desktop-theme-reviewers,tabbrowser-reviewers,jswinarton,tgiles,kcochrane\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321985\n", "files": ["browser/components/sidebar/sidebar-main.css", "browser/themes/ThemeVariableMap.sys.mjs", "browser/themes/shared/tabbrowser/tab.nova.tokens.json", "browser/themes/shared/tabbrowser/tab.tokens.css", "browser/themes/shared/tabbrowser/tab.tokens.json", "browser/themes/shared/tabbrowser/tabs.css", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/nova/tokens-figma-primitives.json", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/nova/tokens-figma-theme.json", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/semantic-categories.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/tokens-figma-primitives.json", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/tokens-figma-theme.json", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/tokens-table.mjs", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/src/figma-import.mjs", "tools/lint/stylelint/stylelint-plugin-mozilla/config.mjs"], "git_node": "5240fbbc45bc0c4abccc2c331c8e42167ea3dd26", "git_parents": ["b2d4d3ed20ee79fbef0a9c389fcc4b4a32253a41"], "node": "cc5864274d59af5173f9149a6f927e4b941c9e54", "parents": ["68b75800848dfd3fda9b81d9c9935213ed47cc7a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Olli Pettay \u003cOlli.Pettay@helsinki.fi\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1932293 - Let the cycle collector see the WebTaskSchedulingState held by SchedulingStateWrapper. r=mccr8\n\nhttps://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/61c7b6d2fe5fc598e573df6528447ab48bc027b3/xpcom/base/CycleCollectedJSRuntime.cpp#1032\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324352\n", "files": ["dom/webscheduling/WebTaskScheduler.cpp", "dom/webscheduling/WebTaskScheduler.h", "dom/webscheduling/tests/crashtests/1932293.html", "dom/webscheduling/tests/crashtests/crashtests.list", "testing/crashtest/crashtests.list", "xpcom/base/CycleCollectedJSContext.cpp"], "git_node": "f8679207d6a571299636e827a9fd0fc5e8b0403f", "git_parents": ["5240fbbc45bc0c4abccc2c331c8e42167ea3dd26"], "node": "e7d047dbde2acfb861f9fd1daf37ae61c480b1a5", "parents": ["cc5864274d59af5173f9149a6f927e4b941c9e54"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Dimi \u003cdlee@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052772 - Part 4: Wait for FOG init before reading Glean in the startup_about_home_paint talos addon r=perftest-reviewers,sparky\n\nThe addon reads its Glean metric as soon as browser-idle-startup-tasks-finished\nfires. That notification says nothing about FOG, which is initialized by a\nseparate startup idle task, so the read can land before initializeFOG has run.\nA blocking Glean read that early does not return nothing, it deadlocks the main\nthread. The browser then sits in startup_about_home_paint cycle 1/20 until the\ntask is killed, with no crash and no stack. The race is pre-existing, but Part 1\nmakes it reliable: it moves the notification onto the thread-level idle queue,\nwhich puts it ahead of initializeFOG.\n\nWait on nsIFOG.initialized from Part 3 before the read; recording is buffered,\nso the measurement survives. Bounded at 15s, half the outputTimeout ffsetup\ngives the warmup run that also loads this addon, and gives up with\nTEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL rather than burning the task. The cached and\nrealworld_webextensions suites share the addon and are fixed too.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324617\n", "files": ["testing/talos/talos/startup_test/startup_about_home_paint/addon/api.js"], "git_node": "efc45c133c218f4fbee4e7b44f366753d91b6a93", "git_parents": ["f8679207d6a571299636e827a9fd0fc5e8b0403f"], "node": "ebd0bb007099e44034c1bab8bc5c3790365529a1", "parents": ["e7d047dbde2acfb861f9fd1daf37ae61c480b1a5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "nickgrato \u003cngrato@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062112 - [Monitor Agent][FE] Create monitor component in tool bar panel r=ngrato,fluent-reviewers,desktop-theme-reviewers,sfoster,bolsson\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321407\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/assets/agent-watch-empty.svg", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/agent-monitor-item/agent-monitor-item.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/agent-monitor-item/agent-monitor-item.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/agent-monitor-item/agent-monitor-item.stories.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/agent-monitor-panel/agent-monitor-panel.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/agent-monitor-panel/agent-monitor-panel.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-tasks/ai-tasks.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/monitors-display/monitor-status-chip.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/monitors-display/monitors-display.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/monitors-display/monitors-display.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/jar.mn", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/AIWindowUI.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/MonitorPanel.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/MonitorUIUtils.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/moz.build", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_aiwindow_agent_monitor_item.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_aiwindow_monitor_button.js", "browser/locales-preview/aiWindow.ftl", "browser/themes/shared/browser-shared.css", "browser/themes/shared/jar.inc.mn", "browser/themes/shared/smartwindowMonitor.css", "browser/themes/shared/toolbarbuttons.css"], "git_node": "87c7e4fb9fe62e8c6955a35ccf5ed8a5c0020c2d", "git_parents": ["efc45c133c218f4fbee4e7b44f366753d91b6a93"], "node": "bc351560809446ad26483f247c035aa0c6ae7614", "parents": ["ebd0bb007099e44034c1bab8bc5c3790365529a1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "calu \u003ccalu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070258 - Record tab group onboarding impressions with side effect r=android-reviewers,007\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324410\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/ui/tabpage/TabLayout.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/tabstray/ui/tabpage/TabLayoutTest.kt"], "git_node": "c74e397e7bac58b7ef954e6f96b7a78d82c4adb0", "git_parents": ["87c7e4fb9fe62e8c6955a35ccf5ed8a5c0020c2d"], "node": "aac73f09cc074064e2be4cb58a181fe0a4d6c01e", "parents": ["bc351560809446ad26483f247c035aa0c6ae7614"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rolf Rando \u003crrando@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070374 - Source tags feature for deduplication r=dimi\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324471\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/all.js", "toolkit/components/formautofill/shared/FormAutofillHeuristics.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "accd78c26a5ea000328a924f090ec2635065558e", "git_parents": ["c74e397e7bac58b7ef954e6f96b7a78d82c4adb0"], "node": "6697332a79baf6ca4471c63e96aa11e84399be10", "parents": ["aac73f09cc074064e2be4cb58a181fe0a4d6c01e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070400 - Pt 1 - Stop storing the snapped leaf clip rect on the clip tree r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nThe stored copy had one writer and one reader, in the same loop iteration.\nIt is passed to set_active_clips rather than snapped there, because that\nfunction re-targets its snapper per clip node.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324494\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/clip.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/visibility.rs"], "git_node": "2b0df47e9391c5ebb1fe16ad27895fd8e828eb4e", "git_parents": ["accd78c26a5ea000328a924f090ec2635065558e"], "node": "0b1edf5858a216541978478ae4360896199e739c", "parents": ["6697332a79baf6ca4471c63e96aa11e84399be10"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070400 - Pt 2 - Move the clip root stack into frame visibility state r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nIt is frame state, and holding it on the scene's clip tree was the last\nreason frame building borrowed that tree mutably.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324495\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/clip.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/frame_builder.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/visibility.rs"], "git_node": "5e3d17a2c5f7ca90b65a7a63d7d774462302fef1", "git_parents": ["2b0df47e9391c5ebb1fe16ad27895fd8e828eb4e"], "node": "81e3cfadf3888c646e446b65e7fecc8ffe2751d0", "parents": ["0b1edf5858a216541978478ae4360896199e739c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070400 - Pt 3 - Derive the snap policy from PrimitiveKind r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nNothing used the node id the clip leaf stored for this; both consumers only\ncompared it against the INVALID sentinel to recover a bool, which is a property\nof the primitive type. SNAP_CLIPS and the sentinel go too, so a ClipNodeId is\nalways a real node.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324496\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/clip.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/text_run.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/visibility.rs"], "git_node": "c88a20987ea11de9d93f61bbfe1d39e78261f859", "git_parents": ["5e3d17a2c5f7ca90b65a7a63d7d774462302fef1"], "node": "eedaf8a9339d49a055c74982b69895db48a06c92", "parents": ["81e3cfadf3888c646e446b65e7fecc8ffe2751d0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070400 - Pt 4 - Move the clip chain start onto the primitive instance r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nFree: it fills existing padding, so PrimitiveInstance stays 32 bytes. Neither\nproducer transformed the node, so callers already had the value. With it,\nset_active_clips no longer needs a leaf id, and the tile cache stores a node\nid rather than a leaf that held nothing but max_rect.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324497\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/clip.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/slice_builder.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/visibility.rs"], "git_node": "800d19001e59dcfeed5f0bba5460785bdcc73db9", "git_parents": ["c88a20987ea11de9d93f61bbfe1d39e78261f859"], "node": "6303598d28aae1b836974734f1acea851b219ddf", "parents": ["eedaf8a9339d49a055c74982b69895db48a06c92"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070400 - Pt 5 - Make PictureIndex a u32 rather than a usize r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nIt was the only thing forcing eight-byte alignment on PrimitiveKind, which\ndrops from 24 bytes to 16, and PrimitiveInstance from 32 to 24. SpatialNodeIndex\nand ClipTaskIndex are already u32.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324498\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/frame_builder.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/picture.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/picture_graph.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prepare.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/render_backend.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/slice_builder.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/visibility.rs"], "git_node": "e493856d430d35feebb1766cdde042fc4a9c0253", "git_parents": ["800d19001e59dcfeed5f0bba5460785bdcc73db9"], "node": "91c38d83d6bc104df64dbeb7b4b0f497f1aa3da7", "parents": ["6303598d28aae1b836974734f1acea851b219ddf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070400 - Pt 6 - Remove ClipTreeLeaf and intern the local clip rect r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nThe rect is display-list content like prim_rect, and normalize_common already\nstrips the external scroll offset from it, so keying on it leaves prim_uid\nscroll-stable. Scene building takes it as an argument instead, since a template\ndoes not exist yet at that point.\n\nPrimitiveInstance drops from 24 to 20 bytes; each key and template grows by the\nrect's 16. Fragmentation should be limited to primitives sharing a prim rect but\ndiffering in clip, mainly borders and backgrounds split across continuations.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324499\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/clip.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/picture.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/borders.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/gradient/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/image.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/line_dec.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/rectangle.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/text_run.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/render_backend.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/slice_builder.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/visibility.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/key_types.rs"], "git_node": "6f10d03d2256d607964e7ea9cf15b5807289c9c5", "git_parents": ["e493856d430d35feebb1766cdde042fc4a9c0253"], "node": "745e7684a63c54b9e6c64562c956a3e236823c00", "parents": ["91c38d83d6bc104df64dbeb7b4b0f497f1aa3da7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070531 - Only check attr taintedness for equality in the places we need to do so. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,dshin\n\nThat is, in the places where we are deciding to potentially replace a\nvalue with another (the property deduplication, and the fast path to\navoid the cascade).\n\nOtherwise we'd fail /css/css-values/attr-universal-selector.html\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324749\n", "files": ["servo/components/style/custom_properties_map.rs", "servo/components/style/properties/cascade.rs", "servo/components/style/properties_and_values/value.rs", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-conditional/container-queries/style-query-attr-tainted.html"], "git_node": "e6fab792b2be222774303d7714ca94e21183e6b4", "git_parents": ["6f10d03d2256d607964e7ea9cf15b5807289c9c5"], "node": "8838df6b561db51b5810e9ca6da393d8f4d0a5c6", "parents": ["745e7684a63c54b9e6c64562c956a3e236823c00"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Cristian Tuns \u003cctuns@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2070400 - Pt 6 - Remove ClipTreeLeaf and intern the local clip rect r=gfx-reviewers,nical\"\n\nThis reverts commit 6f10d03d2256d607964e7ea9cf15b5807289c9c5.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2070400 - Pt 5 - Make PictureIndex a u32 rather than a usize r=gfx-reviewers,nical\"\n\nThis reverts commit e493856d430d35feebb1766cdde042fc4a9c0253.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2070400 - Pt 4 - Move the clip chain start onto the primitive instance r=gfx-reviewers,nical\"\n\nThis reverts commit 800d19001e59dcfeed5f0bba5460785bdcc73db9.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2070400 - Pt 3 - Derive the snap policy from PrimitiveKind r=gfx-reviewers,nical\"\n\nThis reverts commit c88a20987ea11de9d93f61bbfe1d39e78261f859.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2070400 - Pt 2 - Move the clip root stack into frame visibility state r=gfx-reviewers,nical\"\n\nThis reverts commit 5e3d17a2c5f7ca90b65a7a63d7d774462302fef1.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2070400 - Pt 1 - Stop storing the snapped leaf clip rect on the clip tree r=gfx-reviewers,nical\"\n\nThis reverts commit 2b0df47e9391c5ebb1fe16ad27895fd8e828eb4e.\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/clip.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/frame_builder.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/picture.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/picture_graph.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prepare.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/borders.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/gradient/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/image.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/line_dec.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/rectangle.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/text_run.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/render_backend.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/slice_builder.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/visibility.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender_api/src/key_types.rs"], "git_node": "e8dbddf8e0d65d4e836c702b5f574b66615ccfc1", "git_parents": ["e6fab792b2be222774303d7714ca94e21183e6b4"], "node": "5546420efcb4f4e79863dfdcfbb51b9f6cdde70b", "parents": ["8838df6b561db51b5810e9ca6da393d8f4d0a5c6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from https://github.com/mozilla-l10n/android-l10n CLOSED TREE\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-eo/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-